### 3.4 [Mappings]
### 3.4.1 Creat Mapping
### POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mappings
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mappings
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "subjects":
    {
      "connect":[
        {
          "id":
        }
      ]
    },
      "teacher":
      {
        "connect":
        [
          {
            "id":
          }
        ]
      }
    }
}

### 3.4.2 List all mapping
### GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mappings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mappings?populate=*
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 3.3.3 List with ID mappings
### GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mappings/:id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mappings/:id?populate=*
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 3.4.4 Update Mapping
### PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/mappings
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/mappings/:id
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "subjects":
    {
      "disconnect":[
        {
          "id":
        }
      ],
      "connect":[
        {
          "id":
        }
      ]
    },
      "teacher":
      {
        "connect":
        [
          {
            "id":
          }
        ]
      }
    }
}